<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Measurement</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Pile driving shoes will be measured for payment on the basis of the number of pile driving shoes required.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Unit of Measure</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Unit of measure: each.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT>][<SPT><TTL>Vibration Monitoring</TTL><BRK/>
