<SPT><TTL>Payment</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Payment will be made for costs associated with vibration monitoring.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Measurement</TTL><BRK/>
